206
00:14:01.059 --> 00:14:04.660
Pange mandariinid laua peale.

207
00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.240
Tere,

208
00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.865
häid pühi, häid pühi.

209
00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:15.580
Aga kuskohast onu Wolfgang
nii palju kingitusi võtab tervele

210
00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:19.140
