Too lage talle.

249
00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.620
Kannata natukene veel.

250
00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.380
Vabandust,

251
00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.080
ma ei

252
00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:39.530
