303
00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:38.980
Isa,

304
00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.900
Adalbert, isa, isa.

305
00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:47.580
Siin on teile esmaklassiline
robotkuusk.

306
00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:54.359
Mina ise pidin korraks onu Otto
juurde minema, tulen hiljem,

307
00:21:54.359 --> 00:21:57.660
