talvel teed juua.

338
00:25:56.510 --> 00:25:58.090
Aitäh!

339
00:25:58.190 --> 00:26:00.640
Jaa. Nii elab ära.

340
00:26:19.790 --> 00:26:22.165
Nüüd eks saite.

341
00:26:24.160 --> 00:26:26.560
Kui ilusad!

342
00:26:26.660 --> 00:26:30.340
Timo, mis sina said?
Mina sain ilusa punase salli. Ah

343
00:26:36.330 --> 00:26:38.769
