364
00:28:12.220 --> 00:28:15.460
Nii kahju,
et Adalbert peole ei jõudnud.

365
00:28:18.619 --> 00:28:22.540
Aga see tema robotkuusk,
see on suurepärane, nii abivalmis.

366
00:28:23.480 --> 00:28:26.980
Imeline leiutis! Remo,
teeme nüüd isa kingituse lahti.

367
00:28:27.080 --> 00:28:30.820
Vaatame, mis see siis on. Ei,
isa tahab ikka ise teha. Aga palun,

368
00:28:31.260 --> 00:28:35.650
nii põnev on. Teeme, teeme, teeme,
teeme,

369
00:28:35.750 --> 00:28:38.475
teeme. Viilume siis natukene.

370
00:28:44.300 --> 00:28:47.480
Mis see on? Ei tea, see on väga ilus.

371
00:28:48.520 --> 00:28:50.895
Nagu mingi orb.

372
00:28:52.540 --> 00:28:55.460
Oota, oota, oota, oota, oota, oota.

373
00:28:55.560 --> 00:28:57.120
Oota,

374
00:28:57.220 --> 00:28:59.700
oota, mina olen selle orb,
mina olen ordi. Ma ilmselt tahaks

375
00:28:59.800 --> 00:29:03.460
