jänesele, kes saab korda nii.

393
00:30:13.400 --> 00:30:17.060
Kas ma riputan
selle sulle nüüd külge ka?

394
00:30:18.080 --> 00:30:20.230
Külge?

395
00:30:38.610 --> 00:30:39.630
Lotte,

396
00:30:39.730 --> 00:30:43.090
